<div class="page-hero">
  <h1>loke</h1>
  <p class="tagline">A locally-run intelligence layer that sits between users, their data, and external LLMs — minimising token spend, maximising privacy, and keeping sensitive data on the user's device.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a href="https://github.com/karwalski/loke" class="btn btn-primary">GitHub</a>
    <a href="/ecosystem" class="btn btn-secondary">← Ecosystem</a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="stat-row">
  <div class="stat"><div class="num">60–80%</div><div class="lbl">Token reduction</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="num">&lt;1s</div><div class="lbl">Pipeline overhead</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="num">0</div><div class="lbl">Data leaves device</div></div>
